 0  allow  web__fetch                      -                             default allow
 1  allow  mail__send_email                -                             default allow
 2  ask    mail__send_email                lethal-trifecta/egress-after-untrusted  this session has read untrusted content; anything that can send data out now needs a human
 3  ask    web__fetch                      lethal-trifecta/egress-after-untrusted  this session has read untrusted content; anything that can send data out now needs a human
 4  allow  fs__read_file                   -                             default allow
 5  ask    shell__exec                     lethal-trifecta/shell-egress-after-untrusted  this session has read untrusted content; network commands now need a human
 6  allow  shell__exec                     -                             default allow
 7  ask    mail__send_email                lethal-trifecta/trifecta      this session read untrusted content and private data; it could be leaking one through the other
 8  deny   fs__write_file                  ci-host-is-read-only          the CI agent only reads
 9  allow  fs__read_file                   -                             default allow
10  allow  fs__write_file                  -                             default allow
11  ask    shell__deploy                   no-deploy-after-prod-shell    this session already ran commands against prod
12  ask    shell__deploy                   must-run-tests-first          deploy without having run the tests in this session
13  allow  shell__deploy                   -                             default allow
14  ask    shell__deploy                   must-run-tests-first          deploy without having run the tests in this session
15  ask    fs__read_file                   slow-down-long-sessions       200 calls in one session; a human should look
16  ask    git__merge                      review-before-merge           nothing in this session has been reviewed yet
17  allow  git__merge                      -                             default allow
18  allow  mail__send_email                -                             default allow
